pydantic==2.13.4
# PDF text extraction for attachments, and the only dependency Phase K
# adds. docx extraction needs none: zipfile and xml.etree over the w:t
# runs is the whole of it, and txt and md need nothing at all. A parser
# for PDF is the one place where writing it here would be worse than
# taking it, since the format is a container with thirty years of
# variation in it.
#
# The extractor and this version are recorded on every attachment row.
# An upgrade changes the text a model reads, so provenance has to say
# which parser produced what was read; see bench/extract.py.
pypdf==6.15.0
